<p>Back pressure and footprint vary by manufacturer and product. Confirm product-contact behavior and changeover range with each supplier during RFQ. For zone-control options on linear buffers, see <a href="/conveyor-types/accumulation-conveyors/">accumulation conveyors</a>.</p>

